span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="3:01.287" end="3:01.667">ai</span><span begin="3:01.667" end="3:02.077">mai</span> <span begin="3:02.077" end="3:02.287">na</span> <span begin="3:02.287" end="3:02.637">ima</span> <span begin="3:02.637" end="3:02.777">ga</span> <span begin="3:02.777" end="3:03.077">ta</span><span begin="3:03.077" end="3:03.287">da</span> <span begin="3:03.287" end="3:03.777">ito</span><span begin="3:03.777" end="3:04.107">shii</span> <span begin="3:04.107" end="3:04.417">ka</span><span begin="3:04.417" end="3:04.787">ra</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="3:05.033" end="3:05.213">ki</span><span begin="3:05.213" end="3:05.633">ka</span><span begin="3:05.633" end="3:05.953">na</span><span begin="3:05.953" end="3:06.183">i</span><span begin="3:06.183" end="3:06.583">de</span> <span begin="3:06.803" end="3:07.023">hon</span><span begin="3:07.023" end="3:07.423">to</span> <span begin="3:07.423" end="3:07.703">no</span> <span begin="3:07.703" end="3:07.893">to</span><span begin="3:07.893" end="3:08.313">ko</span> <span begin="3:08.313" end="3:08.803">nan</span><span begin="3:08.803" end="3:10.623">te</span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="3:10.838" end="3:11.258">iu</span> <span begin="3:11.258" end="3:11.487">ma</span><span begin="3:11.487" end="3:11.718">de</span> <span begin="3:11.718" end="3:11.858">mo</span> <span begin="3:11.858" end="3:12.158">nai</span> <span begin="3:12.158" end="3:12.568">yo</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>Shota Horie</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">刚才那只是玩笑啦</text><text for="L2">愈发遥远的 那些焦灼难言的话</text><text for="L3">都怪这低气压作祟</text><text for="L4">就算俯身细看 镜子终究只是镜子</text><text for="L5">水洼之中 不过是自言自语罢了</text><text for="L6">回荡着 折射着</text><text for="L7">在不经意的瞬间 悄然心动</text><text for="L8">装作若无其事 终究不如想象中那般</text><text for="L9">轻易就能做到 实在令人伤感</text><text for="L10">没有下不停的雨 你这样对我说</text><text for="L11">那我就再多淋一会儿雨吧</text><text for="L12">虽说无法将一切都冲刷殆尽</text><text for="L13">淡彩细雨 之所以悄然晕开</text><text for="L14">只因这暧昧的此刻 实在令人眷恋</text><text for="L15">别再追问 真正的心意究竟如何</text><text for="L16">你不必知道就好</text><text for="L17">完全偏离了方向呢</text><text for="L18">心底的盘算啊 大抵总会落空</text><text for="L19">却还是忍不住暗自祈愿</text><text for="L20">若是你也如我一般</text><text for="L21">怀着同样的心意</text><text for="L22">那该是多么美好的事 只是</text><text for="L23">说着世上没有绝对的</text><text for="L24">你那双唇 若此刻能够轻轻封住</text><text for="L25">终究无法如愿 所谓命运的捉弄</text><text for="L26">我已经 不再那样想了</text><text for="L27">没有不会停歇的雨 你却这样说着</text><text for="L28">明明满心酸楚 却愈发装作浑不在意</text><text for="L29">不如就这样一直藏身雨中 静静哭泣吧</text><text for="L30">淡彩细雨 之所以悄然晕染</text><text for="L31">只因梦醒的时刻 实在令我畏惧</text><text for="L32">别来问我 心底真实的想法</text><text for="L33">那都无关紧要啊</text><text for="L34">没有永不停歇的雨 你轻声说道</text><text for="L35">云层裂开缝隙 泛起洁白微光</text><text for="L36">哪怕再多片刻也好 请留在我身旁</text><text for="L37">淡彩细雨 之所以悄然晕开</text><text for="L38">只因这暧昧的此刻 实在令人眷恋</text><text for="L39">别再问了 真正的心意罢了</text><text for="L40">早已不言而喻了啊</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.568"><div begin="0:14.319" end="3:12.568"><p begin="0:14.319" end="0:16.099" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.319" end="0:14.569">さっ</span><span begin="0:14.569" end="0:14.839">き</span><span begin="0:14.839" end="0:15.159">のは</span><span begin="0:15.159" end="0:15.369">冗</span><span begin="0:15.369" end="0:15.729">談</span><span begin="0:15.729" end="0:16.099">よ</span></p><p begin="0:16.089" end="0:19.599" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.089" end="0:16.389">余</span><span begin="0:16.389" end="0:16.629">計</span><span begin="0:16.629" end="0:16.949">に遠</span><span begin="0:16.949" end="0:17.119">ざ</span><span begin="0:17.119" end="0:17.529">か</span><span begin="0:17.529" end="0:17.799">る</span> <span begin="0:17.899" end="0:18.189">も</span><span begin="0:18.189" end="0:18.479">どか</span><span begin="0:18.479" end="0:18.689">しい</span><span begin="0:18.689" end="0:18.973">言</span><span begin="0:18.973" end="0:19.289">葉</span><span begin="0:19.289" end="0:19.599">は</span></p><p begin="0:19.715" end="0:21.458" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.715" end="0:19.928">低</span><span begin="0:19.928" end="0:20.198">気</span><span begin="0:20.198" end="0:20.518">圧</span><span begin="0:20.518" end="0:20.648">の</span><span begin="0:20.648" end="0:21.098">せい</span><span begin="0:21.098" end="0:21.458">だ</span></p><p begin="0:21.458" end="0:24.900" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.458" end="0:21.960">覗</span><span begin="0:21.960" end="0:22.310">き込ん</span><span begin="0:22.310" end="0:22.522">でみ</span><span begin="0:22.522" end="0:22.810">たっ</span><span begin="0:22.810" end="0:23.294">て</span> <span begin="0:23.294" end="0:23.850">鏡</span><span begin="0:23.850" end="0:24.040">は</span><span begin="0:24.040" end="0:24.900">鏡</span></p><p begin="0:25.041" end="0:28.791" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.041" end="0:25.601">水</span><span begin="0:25.601" end="0:26.181">た</span><span begin="0:26.181" end="0:26.651">ま</span><span begin="0:26.651" end="0:26.801">り</span> <span begin="0:26.801" end="0:27.521">独</span><span begin="0:27.521" end="0:27.921">り</span><span begin="0:27.921" end="0:28.341">言</span><span begin="0:28.341" end="0:28.611">だ</span><span begin="0:28.611" end="0:28.791">よ</span></p><p begin="0:28.839" end="0:31.332" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.839" end="0:29.092">こ</span><span begin="0:29.092" end="0:29.242">だ</span><span begin="0:29.242" end="0:29.422">ま</span><span begin="0:29.422" end="0:29.672">し</span><span begin="0:29.672" end="0:29.972">て</span> <span begin="0:30.172" end="0:30.532">反</span><span begin="0:30.532" end="0:30.762">射</span><span begin="0:30.762" end="0:31.002">し</span><span begin="0:31.002" end="0:31.332">て</span></p><p begin="0:31.495" end="0:35.503" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begi